VALUES (943815, 'Oxford Original Approved AA Slim Jeans', 'Oxford Products', 'Apparel & Accessories / Clothing / Activewear / Motorcycle Protective Clothing / Motorcycle Pants', 'Riding Gear', 'Black', 139.99, 4, 'The Oxford Original Approved AA Slim Jeans are single layer riding jeans featuring CE AA rated Armourlite denim with CE level 2 protectors for lightweight and comfortable street riding.', 'Oxford Original Approved AA Slim Jeans The Oxford Original Approved AA Slim Jeans are single layer riding jeans featuring CE AA rated Armourlite denim with CE level 2 protectors for lightweight and comfortable street riding. Features: Oxford’s Approved Denim Armourlite - highly durable denim that maintains a vintage look and softness Level 2 CE armor on knees Two-way stretch was added to enhance mobility and comfort Quick dry technology which draws sweat and increases water repellency Single layer Quick drying Lightweight');